"```xml\n<ContentView xmlns=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui\" xmlns:x=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml\" x:Class=\"myapp.customstacklayout\">\n    <ContentView.Resources>\n        <ControlTemplate x:Key=\"template\">\n            <StackLayout>\n                <StackLayout x:Name=\"header\">\n                    <!-- some title things here, such as a header label etc -->\n                </StackLayout>\n                <StackLayout x:Name=\"content\">\n                    <ContentPresenter/>\n                </StackLayout>\n                <StackLayout x:Name=\"footer\">\n                    <!-- some footer things here, such as a summary label etc -->\n                </StackLayout>\n            </StackLayout>\n        </ControlTemplate>\n    </ContentView.Resources>\n    <ContentView.ContentTemplate>\n        <ControlTemplate TargetType=\"ContentView\">\n            <local:CustomStackLayout x:Name=\"customStackLayout\" Template=\"{StaticResource template}\"/>\n        </ControlTemplate>\n    </ContentView.ContentTemplate>\n</ContentView>\n```\n\nAnd in your `CustomStackLayout` class:\n\n```csharp\npublic class CustomStackLayout : StackLayout\n{\n    public static readonly BindableProperty ContentProperty = BindableProperty.Create(\"Content\", typeof(Visual), typeof(CustomStackLayout), null, BindingMode.TwoWay, null);\n\n    public Visual Content\n    {\n        get { return (Visual)GetValue(ContentProperty); }\n        set { SetValue(ContentProperty, value); }\n    }\n}\n```"
