e following command:\n\n```bash\nsudo curl -sSLo /usr/local/bin/kubelogin https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubelogin/releases/download/v0.9.0/kubelogin-linux-amd64 && chmod +x /usr/local/bin/kubelogin\n```"
